[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前のクラス、何やるか決まったー？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Has your class decided what to do yet?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "男子生徒Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Male Student A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "無難に喫茶店。お前んところは？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're playing it safe with a café. How about yours?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "男子生徒Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Male Student B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うちは、うにすくい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're doing an uni scooping game."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "男子生徒Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Male Student A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうやってすくうんだよソレ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How does that even work?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "男子生徒Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Male Student B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どこも文化祭の話題で持ちきりですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone's talking about the cultural festival."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だねえ。それにいつも以上に混んでる気が……\n空いてる席はーっと……お、あった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. And it seems more crowded than usual... Let's see, any free seats... Oh, there's one!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どーも。お邪魔しまーす",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey there. Mind if we join you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、お二人とも。こんにちは",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, hello you two."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あらあら。科学学校の人たちがなんの用かしら？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My, my. What business do our Science Academy friends have with us?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "席が空いてないから仕方なく座っただけですー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's just that there weren't any other seats available."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmph!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ふたり",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Both"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あはは、相変わらず仲がいいなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haha, don't you all get along well!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あの……文化祭の時期って毎年こんな感じなんですか？\u3000\nなんというか、熱量がすごいなあって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um... is the cultural festival always this intense? The enthusiasm is incredible."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあね。この学園の伝統みたいなもん……\nって、ＯＧのマルローネ先生も言ってたよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Pretty much. It's like a school tradition... at least that's what Miss Marlone said when she visited."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お客さんもいっぱい来るし、投票企画もあるしね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We get tons of visitors, and there's even a voting competition."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "投票？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Voting?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "来場者にどの出し物が良かったか選んでもらう……\nみたいな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Like... visitors choose which exhibit they liked best?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その通り！\u3000２日間の開催での累計投票数を競うんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's right! Exhibits compete for the most votes over the two-day festival."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "一番票を集めて最優秀賞に選ばれると、\n超豪華な特典が贈られるの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The one that collects the most votes and wins the grand prize gets something amazing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほほう……それは気になりますなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oho... now that's interesting."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お二人は何かやられるんですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you two planning to do something for the festival?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、何かやろうかって話はしてるけど。\n具体的なことはこれから考えるつもり",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, we've talked about doing something, but we're still figuring out the details."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、どうせやるならテッペン狙いたいね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That said, if we're going to participate, I'd want to aim for the top."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頑張りましょう、ハイディさん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's do our best, Heidi!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……無理よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Not going to happen."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なぜなら、一番を取るのは私たち錬金術部だから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Because the Alchemy Club will be taking first place."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へへっ、上等じゃん。\nあんたらを負かして、私たちが一番取ってやる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heh, bring it on! We'll beat you and take the top spot ourselves!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぬぬぬぬぬぬ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Grrrrr..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ふたり",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Both"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だーかーら、みんな仲良くー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come ooooon, everyone! Let's all get along!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]